Third-party material in this directory
=====================================

index.json, repo.json and the extension sources embedded in http/*.json
(the "body" of each exchange whose URL is on raw.githubusercontent.com) come
from the Mangayomi extensions repository:

  https://github.com/entityJY/mangayomi-extensions-eJ (the fork every JS
  source in Mangayomi's official index points at)
  commit f21a60bf026dd122f9b80042e1c3d220a38aa07a
  files: index.json, repo.json,
         javascript/manga/src/en/weebcentral.js,
         javascript/manga/src/all/webtoons.js,
         javascript/manga/src/all/mangadex.js

Copyright the Mangayomi extensions contributors. Licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE next to this file. The upstream
repository ships no NOTICE file.

The files are unmodified. The extension sources are stored as recorded HTTP
responses (the exact bytes served, JSON-string encoded in the "body" field)
because Kartka installs an extension by fetching that URL.

The other exchanges in http/*.json are HTTP responses recorded from the
sites those extensions read (weebcentral.com, webtoons.com, mangadex.org),
kept only as offline test fixtures.

Kartka's Mangayomi shim (lib/plugins/mangayomi/) is written independently
against Mangayomi's public extension API and contains no Mangayomi code.
